this translates to 90 terabytes on average of raw audio data, and this doesn't include the replicas across different regions,

236
00:27:07,632 --> 00:27:10,432
那些可能是同一首歌的重复备份。
which might be duplicates of the same song.

237
00:27:10,672 --> 00:27:13,552
它也不包括版本管理开销。
and it also doesn't include the versioning overhead.

238
00:27:13,712 --> 00:27:21,092
当艺术家出于某些原因重新上传歌曲时，比如他们想修改点什么，结果只是重新上传了同一首歌曲。
when artists re-upload the songs for certain reasons. Let's say they want to change something and they just end up re-uploading the same song.

239
00:27:21,550 --> 00:27:29,476
这就是为什么我们需要预估的容量要比我们目前计算出的 90TB 高出至少两到三倍。
So that's why we will also need to estimate this like at least two or three times higher than the amount that we have here, which is 90 terabytes.

240
00:27:30,350 --> 00:27:37,892
对于歌曲元数据，假设每首歌曲都需要标题、艺术家引用、时长、文件 URL 等信息。
For song metadata, let's say each song needs a title, artist references, duration, file URLs, and so on.

