00:31:42,702 --> 00:31:48,196
接着，请求会到达负载均衡器，它会将请求路由到 API 服务器。
And then after that, we'll hit the load balancer, which will route the request to the API server.

279
00:31:48,718 --> 00:31:54,468
作为第一步，API 服务器将验证用户是否通过 JWT 令牌通过身份验证。
API server as a first step it will validate whether the user is authenticated with the JWT token.

