00:44:17,038 --> 00:44:25,328
而且播放列表项索引可以加快查询速度，无论是获取特定播放列表中的歌曲，还是查找包含
And the playlist item index will speed up the queries when fetching songs for a specific playlist or finding which playlists contain

398
00:44:25,488 --> 00:44:26,532
特定歌曲的播放列表。
a specific song.

