00:46:04,448 --> 00:46:16,208
这里非常适合使用 LRU 缓存方法，当存储空间填满时，它会自动移除最少访问的内容，并且在缓存未命中时，
And here it's a good use case to use the LRU cache method, which is automatically removing the least accessed content when storage fills up, and the cache would fetch from the origin

416
00:46:16,368 --> 00:46:17,828
缓存将从源存储中获取。
storage on a cache miss.

417
00:46:18,528 --> 00:46:26,528
对于 API 服务器，由于我们不维护任何类型的用户会话或任何存储，它们是完全无状态的，
For the API servers, since we are not maintaining any type of user session or any storage, these are completely stateless,

418
00:46:26,688 --> 00:46:31,652
这意味着我们可以根据需要增加足够的服务器来处理涌入的流量。
meaning we can scale them as many as needed to handle the incoming traffic.

419
00:46:32,174 --> 00:46:34,928
因此，在这里增加容量非常简单。
So adding more capacity here is straightforward.

