00:46:38,638 --> 00:46:48,196
这里的核心点是，在设计 API 服务器时，我们需要将其设计为真正的无状态服务器，这样我们才能轻松地进行扩展。
The main thing here is that when designing the API server, we need to design for truly stateless servers so that it's possible for us to scale this easily.

422
00:46:48,368 --> 00:47:00,164
接下来，我们还需要扩展数据库，因为单台实例无法处理大量的元数据存储，这意味着我们需要将数据库中的读取和写入分离。
Next, we need to also scale the database because the single instance cannot handle that many metadata storage, which means we need to separate the reads and the writes in the databases.

423
00:47:00,368 --> 00:47:09,732
对于写入操作，我们可以使用主节点副本，用户创建的新歌曲文件或新播放列表都将写入到这里。
For the writes, we can use a leader replica where we will be writing the new files of the songs or new playlists that users are creating.

424
00:47:10,158 --> 00:47:17,248
但在读取时，我们可以使用一些从节点或跟随者数据库，它们仅用于读取。
But when reading it, we can have some slave or follower databases which will be only used for reading.

425
00:47:17,422 --> 00:47:20,516
因此，这些数据将与主数据库保持同步。
So this will be in sync with the leader database.

426
00:47:21,008 --> 00:47:30,692
每当我们有任何读取操作，比如获取歌曲元数据或播放列表元数据时，我们都会从跟随者数据库中读取。
But whenever we get any read operations like getting the song metadata, getting the playlist metadata, we will be reading them from the follower databases.

427
00:47:31,630 --> 00:47:36,176
