01:10:14,560 --> 01:10:25,120
因为如果有许多开发人员，比如成百上千的人在开发这一个单体系统，那么很难进行独立部署，并且在工作时
because if many developers, let's say hundreds of developers, are working on this single monolith, then it becomes very hard to deploy independently and work

