1103
02:03:22,496 --> 02:03:32,256
这个在线状态服务器将接收来自用户的心跳、来自 Redis 的更新，并将在线状态的变化发布给感兴趣的订阅者
This presence server will receive the heartbeats from users, updates from the Redis, and also publish the presence changes to the interested subscribers

1104
02:03:32,416 --> 02:03:37,380
比如用户 A，他关心用户 B 是否在线或离线。
like the user A, which is interested whether the user B is online or offline.

1105
02:03:38,030 --> 02:03:44,196
现在让我们来选择移动应用与服务、即聊天服务器之间的通信方式。
Now let's choose the communication method between the mobile app and the services, the chat servers.

1106
02:03:44,416 --> 02:03:49,252
我们这里有三种选择：轮询、长轮询和 WebSocket 通信。
We have three options here polling, long polling, and WebSocket communication.

1107
02:03:49,710 --> 02:03:58,084
当然，大多数通讯应用都使用 WebSocket 进行通信，但让我们通过分析它们的优缺点来了解其中的原因。
Of course, most messaging apps use WebSocket for communication, but let's understand why is that the case by looking at their pros and cons.

1108
02:03:58,510 --> 02:04:00,656
我们先从轮询选项开始。
Let's start with the polling option.

1109
02:04:00,846 --> 02:04:04,932
假设这一侧是客户端，而那边是聊天服务器。
Let's say you have the client on this side and then chat server on that side.

1110
02:04:05,520 --> 02:04:08,400
在普通的轮询方案中，它的工作原理是这样的。
With regular polling option, this is how it works.

1111
02:04:08,560 --> 02:04:16,880
前端会通过某个 API 端点定期轮询后端，询问是否有新消息。
We will do periodic polling from the front end to backend asking whether they have any new messages or not with some API endpoint.

1112
02:04:17,198 --> 02:04:24,720
假设此时没有新消息，服务器就会返回一个空响应，表示目前没有新消息。
And then let's say we don't have any new messages, so this will be an empty response saying that there are no new messages in the server.

1113
02:04:25,038 --> 02:04:31,492
过了一段时间后，我们仍需查询同样的内容，询问是否有新消息。
And then from some time again, we will also need to query the same thing and ask whether there are any new messages.

1114
02:04:31,680 --> 02:04:37,892
假设第二次查询时有新消息，那么客户端就会收到这些消息。
And then let's say for the second time there are new messages, so they will receive the messages that they received.

1115
02:04:38,240 --> 02:04:47,204
这种方式如你所见，非常浪费带宽并增加延迟，因为如果你每两秒检查一次，而消息恰好在你检查后才到达，
This, as you can see, wastes a lot of bandwidth and adds latency because if you're checking every two seconds and the message arrives right after you check,

1116
02:04:47,520 --> 02:04:51,012
你就得等两秒才能看到它，而本可以立即收到。
you wait two seconds to see it while you could get it instantly.

1117
02:04:51,566 --> 02:04:59,716
而且如果把这乘以数百万个不断请求更新的用户，即使聊天服务器上没有任何新内容，
And if you also multiply that by the millions of users constantly asking for updates, even when there is nothing new in the chat server,

1118
02:05:00,046 --> 02:05:02,788
你也在白白浪费大量的资源。
you're burning a lot of resources for no reason.

1119
02:05:03,120 --> 02:05:07,268
这就是为什么长轮询是一个更好的方案。
That's why one better approach than this is the long polling option.

1120
02:05:07,726 --> 02:05:11,120
在这种情况下，我们会等待新消息或直到超时。
In this case, we wait for the new messages or timeout.

1121
02:05:11,406 --> 02:05:19,040
也就是说，我们向服务器请求新消息，然后聊天服务器会等待一段时间直到超时。
So let's say we request the new messages from the server, and then the chat server will wait for some time until the timeout.

1122
02:05:19,280 --> 02:05:22,980
如果有新消息，它会将其推送回客户端。
If there are any new messages, it will push them back to the client.

1123
02:05:23,438 --> 02:05:33,188
如果没有新消息，在达到一定超时时间后，它会推送一个响应，同样是一个空响应，说明聊天中没有新消息。
And if there are no new messages, then after some timeout, it will push the response, which will be again an empty response, saying that there are no new messages in the chat.

1124
02:05:33,360 --> 02:05:40,260
如果没收到新消息，则需要再次查询聊天服务器，这个过程会循环往复。
And if there are no new messages, then this needs to again query to the chat server, and then basically this process occurs again.

1125
02:05:40,880 --> 02:05:48,960
这仍然有问题，因为你一直在不断地建立和断开连接，而且每条消息都需要完整的 HTTP 握手。
This is still problematic because you're constantly opening and closing connections, and each message requires a full HTTP handshake.

1126
02:05:49,120 --> 02:05:57,828
在规模化应用中，这依然是很大的开销，因为你的聊天服务器花费在管理连接生命周期上的时间比实际传输消息还要多。
At scale, this is again an overhead because your chat servers spend more time managing connection lifecycles than actually delivering messages.

1127
02:05:58,286 --> 02:06:09,828
此外，还会产生一些闲置的 HTTP 连接，就像这种正在等待响应的情况，它们会占用服务器资源，比如用于维护连接状态的内存
Plus, there will be some idle HTTP connections like in this one where they are waiting for the response, and they will consume the server resources like memory for connection state

1128
02:06:10,080 --> 02:06:14,916
以及线程池槽位，而且还无法获得 WebSockets 的效率优势。
and thread pool slots without the efficiency benefits of WebSockets.

1129
02:06:15,726 --> 02:06:20,036
这就是为什么大多数聊天服务都采用 WebSocket 通信。
That's why most of the chat services work with WebSocket communication.

1130
02:06:20,320 --> 02:06:26,212
这是在聊天服务器和移动应用之间建立的一个持久的双向连接。
This is one persistent bidirectional connection between the chat server and between the mobile app.

1131
02:06:26,670 --> 02:06:30,080
这样，客户端和服务器都可以随时推送数据。
So client and server can both push data at any time.

1132
02:06:30,414 --> 02:06:37,380
首先，客户端会与服务器建立 HTTP 连接，然后进行 WebSocket 握手。
First client will initiate the HTTP connection with the server, and then they will perform the WebSocket handshake.

1133
02:06:37,760 --> 02:06:43,524
从这一刻起，连接就建立了，并且在整个会话期间都是持久的。
And after this point, the connection is established and it is persistent throughout the session.

1134
02:06:43,886 --> 02:06:48,740
这样一来，假设用户 A 给用户 B 发送了一条消息，也就是这个用户。
This way, let's say user A sends a message to user B, which is this user.

1135
02:06:49,230 --> 02:06:59,680
服务器能够独立地将新消息推送给接收到消息的用户 B，一旦有新消息就立即推送。
Server is able to independently push the new messages to the user B, which received the message, so push the new messages as soon as they are available.

1136
02:06:59,920 --> 02:07:07,556
同时，作为用户 B 的客户端也可以在任何时候发送消息或确认收到，而无需建立新连接。
And also the client, which is the user B, is able to send message or acknowledge anytime without making a new connection.

1137
02:07:08,238 --> 02:07:16,740
这种连接是持久的，允许来自聊天服务器端和客户端端的实时双向更新。
And this connection is persistent and allows real-time bidirectional updates both from the chat server side and from the client side.

1138
02:07:17,358 --> 02:07:22,756
WebSockets 的权衡是它需要支持此类协议的特殊负载均衡器。
The trade-offs of WebSockets is that it requires special load balancers that support them.

1139
02:07:23,182 --> 02:07:26,948
所以我们需要使用四层负载均衡，而不是七层。
So we'll need to use layer 4 load balancing instead of layer 7.

1140
02:07:27,374 --> 02:07:35,280
由于你保持连接开启状态，服务器端每个连接也会消耗更多内存，但考虑到实时的特性，这仍然是值得的。
They also use more memory per connection on the server side because you're keeping connections open, but it's still worth it because of the real

1141
02:07:35,440 --> 02:07:39,012
实时消息处理以及对消息延迟的要求。
time messaging and the latency of the message requirements.

1142
02:07:39,598 --> 02:07:45,668
接下来，我们来看看如何管理通过负载均衡器路由的聊天服务器。
Next, let's see how we are going to manage the chat servers which are routed through the load balancer.

1143
02:07:46,606 --> 02:07:53,700
在生产环境和现实情况中，聊天服务器会不断上线和下线，它们会崩溃、重新部署、扩容或缩容。
In production and in reality, chat servers come and go, they will crash, get deployed again, scale up and down.

1144
02:07:54,096 --> 02:07:57,348
那么系统如何追踪哪些服务器是可用的呢？
And how does the system keep track of what's available?

1145
02:07:57,998 --> 02:08:07,216
这里的问题是，负载均衡器需要某种方式来获知哪些服务器可用，比如此时聊天服务器 1 和 2 是可用的，
So the problem here is that the load balancer needs some way to know which servers are available, like chat server 1 and 2 are available at this moment,

1146
02:08:07,376 --> 02:08:14,116
而聊天服务器 3 不健康。假设它要么导致超时，要么在请求时报错。
and chat server 3 is unhealthy. Let's say it either throws timeouts or it's throwing errors on requests.

1147
02:08:14,510 --> 02:08:23,364
所以我们可以采用的一个解决方案是服务发现集群，就像类似于 Consul 或 AWS Cloud Map 的服务注册中心。
So one solution that we can use here is service discovery cluster, like a service registry similar to console or AWS Cloud Map.

1148
02:08:23,822 --> 02:08:25,156
它的工作原理如下：
And here is how it will work.

1149
02:08:25,422 --> 02:08:35,684
每当这些聊天服务器启动时，假设服务器 1 在某个 IP 地址上启动，它就会在服务发现集群中注册自己。
Whenever these chat servers start, let's say this server one boots up on some IP address, it will register itself in this service discovery cluster.

1150
02:08:36,016 --> 02:08:44,292
之后，我们将每隔 10 秒对服务器 1 进行一次健康检查，以确认该服务器是否正常运行。
And after that, we will do health checks every 10 seconds with this server one to see if the server is up and running.

1151
02:08:44,910 --> 02:08:48,740
同样地，我们也会对服务器 2 和服务器 3 执行此操作。
And then similarly, we'll do that for server 2 and server 3.

1152
02:08:49,230 --> 02:08:53,616
现在假设负载均衡器需要一份可用服务器列表。
And now let's say the load balancer needs the list of available servers.

1153
02:08:53,776 --> 02:09:02,788
它会首先从服务发现集群中查询健康的服务器，然后该集群会将服务器列表发送给负载均衡器。
It will first query the healthy servers from the service discovery cluster, and then the cluster will send the server list to the load balancer.

1154
02:09:03,278 --> 02:09:08,868
有了这个新列表，假设我们只转发了聊天服务器 1 和 2 的 IP 地址。
With this new list, let's say we forwarded only the IP address of the chat server 1 and 2.

1155
02:09:09,294 --> 02:09:21,376
这样负载均衡器就能更新路由表，然后仅将所有流量路由到服务器 1 和服务器 2，并且它会知道服务器 3 已从路由中移除，
So the load balancer will be able to update the routing table and then route all the traffic only to server 1 and to server 2, and it will know that server 3 is removed from the routing,

1156
02:09:21,536 --> 02:09:24,644
因此我们不会向服务器 3 发送任何请求。
so we are not making any requests to the server 3.

1157
02:09:24,896 --> 02:09:28,736
这就是我们管理负载均衡和流量路由的方法。
That's how we will manage the load balancing and traffic routing.

1158
02:09:28,910 --> 02:09:35,396
现在让我们进入数据模型，设计我们将要使用的主要数据表。
Now let's move on to the data model and designing the data tables that we will have, the primary ones.

1159
02:09:35,982 --> 02:09:44,388
我们首先需要一个用户表，这个表实际上可以存储在 PostgreSQL 或 MySQL 等 SQL 数据库中。
We will first need a user's table, and this one can be actually stored in a SQL database like PostgreSQL or MySQL.

1160
02:09:44,974 --> 02:09:53,696
用户将有一个 ID 作为主键，然后是一个手机号码（所有用户的号码必须是唯一的），接着是用户名。
So the user will have an ID which will be the primary key, then a phone number, which needs to be unique for all users, then a username

1161
02:09:53,936 --> 02:10:03,376
还有创建时间，这是一个时间戳，以及最后上线时间，我们将用它来控制并向其他用户显示该用户上次在线的时间。
created at which is a timestamp, and last scene, which we will use for controlling and showing to the other users when this user was last online.

1162
02:10:03,854 --> 02:10:08,740
当然，这里还会包含更多字段，但这些是我们需要的主要字段。
And of course, more fields will be here, but these are let's say the primary ones that we will need.

1163
02:10:09,166 --> 02:10:17,696
下一个表是消息表，这实际上是 Cassandra 中的表，我们将在这里存储消息，因为这是一个高
The next table will be messages, which is the table in Cassandra actually, where we will be storing messages since this is a high

1164
02:10:17,856 --> 02:10:22,340
流量的数据库，我们会从中读写大量的消息。
volume database we will be writing and reading a lot of messages from.

1165
02:10:22,958 --> 02:10:29,700
我们需要发送者 ID，它与用户表中的用户 ID 相关联。
We will need the sender ID here, which is the connection with the user ID from the users table.

1166
02:10:30,158 --> 02:10:39,172
我们需要接收者 ID，同样是与用户表中的相同字段关联，以及一个消息 ID，它将作为该表的主键。
We will need the receiver ID, which is again a connection to the same field in the users, and a message ID, which will be the primary key for this table.

1167
02:10:39,536 --> 02:10:45,936
除此之外，还有任何与消息相关的其他内容，比如内容（即文本）、媒体 URL。
Apart from that, any other things that relate with the message like the content, which is the text, media URL.

1168
02:10:46,016 --> 02:10:54,496
如果我们存储语音笔记或任何图像、视频文件，以及消息的状态，状态可以是已发送、已送达
if we are storing any voice notes or any image video files, the status of the message, which will be either sent, delivered

1169
02:10:54,736 --> 02:10:55,332
或已读。
or read,

1170
02:10:56,110 --> 02:11:03,908
还有这条消息送达的时间戳，以及是否被删除，因为用户在 WhatsApp 上也可以删除消息。
the timestamp of when this message was delivered, and whether it's deleted or not, because they are also able to delete messages on WhatsApp.

1171
02:11:04,336 --> 02:11:13,444
为了管理 WhatsApp 上的群组，我们还需要群组和群组成员表，这些可以再次存储在 PostgreSQL 数据库中。
For managing the groups on WhatsApp, we will also need groups and group members tables, and this can be again in the PostgreSQL database.

1172
02:11:13,998 --> 02:11:22,496
对于群组，我们需要每个群组的 ID 作为主键来识别群组，以及群组名称，
For the groups, we will need ID for each group, which will be the primary key which we will use for identifying the group, the name of the group,

1173
02:11:22,656 --> 02:11:26,116
创建时间，以及创建该群组的用户。
when it was created, and who's the user that created this group.

1174
02:11:26,798 --> 02:11:37,636
然后，这是与群组和群组成员之间的一对多关系，其中我们会添加新成员，而这个 ID 是他们被加入的群组 ID，
And then, this is a one-to-many connection with the groups and group members where we will be adding new members, and this is the ID of the group where they are added,

1175
02:11:38,256 --> 02:11:47,076
还有每个成员加入时的角色，以及关联到用户表的用户 ID。用户 ID 就是用户表的主键。
the role of each member when they joined, and the user ID, which links to the users table. User ID, and that's the primary key of users.

1176
02:11:47,456 --> 02:11:56,292
除此之外，还有一个重要的点是建立用户连接注册表，这可以存储在像 Redis 这样的缓存中。
Apart from this, one more important thing is to have user connections registry where let's say this can be stored in a cache like Redis.

1177
02:11:56,590 --> 02:12:04,964
它将存储用户 ID 和他们连接的服务器 ID，如果连接处于开启状态，还会有连接 ID，
This will store the user IDs and the server ID where they are connected to, also the connection ID if it is open,

1178
02:12:05,376 --> 02:12:07,556
最后是最后活跃时间和设备类型。
last active time and device type.

1179
02:12:08,270 --> 02:12:16,420
我们可以将这些添加到 Redis 缓存中，并每隔大约 300 秒通过心跳来更新刷新一次。
And we can add this to the Redis cache and then update every let's say 300 seconds to refresh it with each heart grid.

1180
02:12:17,006 --> 02:12:26,052
一旦有了数据库的 RDBMS 模式，我们就可以进入 API 设计，特别是针对即时通讯应用中的 WebSocket 和 REST API 流程。
Once we have the database ROV schema, we can move on to the API design, specifically for WebSocket and REST API flows for the messaging app.

1181
02:12:26,734 --> 02:12:34,340
客户端的第一步是发送用户 ID、令牌和设备信息来与服务器进行身份验证。
The first step from the client will be to authenticate with the server by sending the user ID, the token and device information.

1182
02:12:34,862 --> 02:12:42,800
如果成功，服务器将返回确认信息，并发送会话 ID、服务器时间以及未读
If it is successful, the server will respond with off success, sending the session ID, the server time, and the unread

1183
02:12:42,928 --> 02:12:43,204
数量。
count.

1184
02:12:43,488 --> 02:12:47,488
到这一步之后，客户端就可以开始发送和接收消息了。
After that point, the client can start sending and receiving messages.

1185
02:12:47,648 --> 02:12:55,728
假设它向接收者发送一条消息，它将发送关于接收者的信息、用户 ID、内容，
Let's say it sends a message to the receiver, so it will send the information about who's the receiver, the user ID, the content,

1186
02:12:55,968 --> 02:12:59,488
如果有媒体文件的话也会包含在内，以及消息的时间戳。
the media if there are any, and the timestamp of the message.

1187
02:12:59,662 --> 02:13:03,408
此时，WebSocket 连接已经建立。
And at this point, the WebSocket connection is already established.

1188
02:13:03,568 --> 02:13:11,716
因此存在双向通信，这意味着服务器也能向客户端推送消息或确认信息。
So there is a bi-directional communication, which means that server is also able to push messages or acknowledgments to the client.

1189
02:13:11,808 --> 02:13:15,332
例如，在收到消息时它会发送确认。
So it will acknowledge, for example, when the message is received.

1190
02:13:15,822 --> 02:13:24,164
它还会投递来自其他用户的任何新消息，比如消息 ID、发送者、内容和媒体文件。
It will also deliver any new messages that there are from other users like the message ID, the sender, the content, and the media files.

1191
02:13:24,368 --> 02:13:29,328
然后客户端也能在收到来自服务器的消息时发送确认。
And then client will be able to also acknowledge when they receive the messages from the server.

1192
02:13:29,614 --> 02:13:34,128
接收只是其中一部分，可能他们收到了但还没打开消息。
The receiving is one part, maybe they received but haven't opened the message.

1193
02:13:34,382 --> 02:13:41,412
一旦他们打开消息，他们也会发送包含消息 ID 和读取时间戳的已读回执。
Once they open the message, they will also send the read receipt with message ID and the timestamp when that was read.

1194
02:13:42,094 --> 02:13:51,008
每当消息被阅读时，服务器都需要用消息 ID 和读取时间来更新已读状态，
Whenever let's say the message was read, the server needs to also update the read receipt with the message ID and when it was read

1195
02:13:51,168 --> 02:13:55,972
这样另一端的发送者也能知道消息是什么时候被读的。
so that the sender who's on the other side also knows when the message was read.

1196
02:13:56,462 --> 02:14:04,292
此外，客户端和服务器需要每隔大约 5 到 10 秒互相维护一次存在心跳。
Also, the client and server need to maintain the presence heartbeat between each other every let's say 5 or 10 seconds.

1197
02:14:04,528 --> 02:14:15,328
因此客户端会检查服务器是否仍然可用，同样地，服务器也需要检查客户端是否在线，因为你可能关闭了手机上的应用或者关闭了
So client will check whether the server is still available, and similarly, the server needs to check whether the client is available because maybe you close the app on your phone or you close

1198
02:14:16,078 --> 02:14:21,892
WhatsApp 的浏览器标签页，在这种情况下，连接需要关闭以避免浪费带宽。
the browser tab of WhatsApp, and in this case the connection needs to be closed to not waste the bandwidth.

1199
02:14:22,208 --> 02:14:26,404
对于上传媒体文件，我们将通过 REST API 来处理。
For uploading the media files, we will handle this through a REST API.

1200
02:14:26,830 --> 02:14:36,048
例如，为了上传文件，我们将使用一个 POST 端点，类似于 /api/media，其中我们将发送文件类型，
For example, for uploading a file, we will use a post endpoint, something like slash API slash media, where we will send the file type,

1201
02:14:36,208 --> 02:14:42,628
文件大小，当然还有文件本身以及上传该文件的对话信息。
the size of the file, and also of course the file and conversation where this file is uploaded to.

1202
02:14:43,438 --> 02:14:49,956
这些将发送到 REST API，它负责处理媒体上传。
So this will be sent to REST API, which will be responsible for handling the media uploads.

1203
02:14:50,128 --> 02:14:54,692
而在另一端，我们还有用于存储这些内容的媒体存储系统。
And then on the other side we have also the media storage where this will be stored.

1204
02:14:54,926 --> 02:15:00,740
服务器将返回上传 URL、媒体 ID 以及该链接的过期时间。
So server will respond with the upload URL, the media ID, and when this expires.

1205
02:15:01,230 --> 02:15:08,548
之后，客户端就可以将上传文件发送到媒体存储系统的预签名 URL 了。
And after that, the client will be able to send the upload file to the pre-signed URL for the media storage.

1206
02:15:08,974 --> 02:15:16,292
一旦上传成功，媒体存储系统会返回上传成功的响应，客户端也会确认收到该信息。
And once upload is successful, the media storage will just respond with the upload success and the client will acknowledge it.

1207
02:15:16,878 --> 02:15:21,924
作为最后一步，假设其中包含需要上传的媒体文件。
And as a last step, let's say it included the media file to be uploaded.

1208
02:15:22,208 --> 02:15:30,368
服务器将确认消息已送达；或者如果在上传文件或发送消息过程中出现任何错误，
The server will just acknowledge that the message was delivered, or if there was any errors while uploading the file or sending the message,

1209
02:15:30,528 --> 02:15:35,332
它将发送“消息发送失败”的响应，并在正文中包含错误信息。
it will send the message delivery failed response with the error message in the body.

1210
02:15:35,630 --> 02:15:37,888
现在我们来讨论多设备同步。
Now let's cover the multi-device sync.

1211
02:15:37,968 --> 02:15:43,648
假设用户 A 有三个设备，用户 B 有两个设备。
Let's say the user A can have three devices and user B can have two devices.

1212
02:15:43,808 --> 02:15:47,140
我们该如何实现不同设备之间的消息同步呢？
How are we going to sync messages between devices as well?

1213
02:15:47,598 --> 02:15:53,168
在这边，我们有用户 A 的手机、平板和桌面电脑。
We have on this side user A's phone, user A's tablet, and user A's desktop.

1214
02:15:53,248 --> 02:15:55,748
这些是用户 A 的三个设备。
These are the three devices for user A.

1215
02:15:56,206 --> 02:15:59,972
而在另一边，我们有用户 B 的手机和笔记本电脑。
And on the other side we have user B's phone and user B's laptop.

1216
02:16:00,622 --> 02:16:08,720
首先，假设发生的第一个交互是用户 A 向聊天服务器 A 发送消息，然后
So, first thing, let's say first interaction that happens is user A sends a message to the chat server A, and then

1217
02:16:08,860 --> 02:16:15,040
聊天服务器会确认并显示这条第一条消息的状态为“已发送”。
chat server will acknowledge and display the status as sent for this first message.

1218
02:16:15,374 --> 02:16:23,812
既然我们约定在 Redis 缓存中存储用户的在线状态，那么聊天服务器 A
Since we agreed that we are going to store the statuses of user's availability in a Redis cache, so the chat server A

1219
02:16:24,240 --> 02:16:26,640
随后会查询：用户 B 在哪里？
will then ask, where is the user B?

1220
02:16:26,800 --> 02:16:32,324
因为假设这条消息是发给用户 B 的，接着 Redis 会做出响应。
because let's say this message was sent to the user B, and then Redis responds.

1221
02:16:32,480 --> 02:16:38,500
它显示用户 B 有两个设备，分别连接在服务器 B 和服务器 E 上。
that user B has two devices, and it is connected on server B, and server E.

1222
02:16:38,718 --> 02:16:39,906
每一个这些设备。
each of these devices.

1223
02:16:40,320 --> 02:16:49,892
第一个用户的另外两个设备也会连接，假设其中一个连接到聊天服务器 C，另一个连接到聊天服务器 D。
The other two devices of first user will be connected, let's say one of them is connected to chat server C and the second one is to chat server D.

1224
02:16:50,400 --> 02:17:00,644
因此，一旦聊天服务器存储了已发送的消息，它还会通过连接用户 A 平板的聊天服务器 C 进行展示。
So the once the chat server stores the sent message, it will also display through the chat server C, which is connected to user A's tablet.

1225
02:17:00,799 --> 02:17:07,906
它会显示已发送消息，而聊天服务器 D 则会为用户 A 的桌面端显示该条已发送消息。
It will display the sent message, and the chat server D will display the sent message for user A's desktop.

1226
02:17:08,494 --> 02:17:13,732
这就是我们如何在第一个用户的三个设备之间同步同一条消息的方法。
This is how we will sync the same message between three devices of first user.

1227
02:17:14,126 --> 02:17:21,058
现在来看看这些消息是如何发送给用户 B，并与用户 B 的两个设备同步的。
Now let's see how these messages are sent to the user B and synced with the two devices that the second user has.

1228
02:17:21,582 --> 02:17:28,959
用户 B 的手机连接到聊天服务器 B，而用户 B 的笔记本电脑连接到聊天服务器 E。
So user B's phone is connected to chat server B and user B's laptop is connected to chat server E.

1229
02:17:29,520 --> 02:17:39,588
聊天服务器 B 将从数据库中读取消息并将其送达给手机，同时这个聊天服务器会将同样的报文送达给笔记本电脑。
The chat server B will read the message from database and deliver it to the phone, and this chat server will deliver the same message to the laptop.

1230
02:17:40,302 --> 02:17:48,611
假设用户 B 从手机上查看了这条消息，它会向发送到该手机的聊天服务器 B 发送确认信息。
And let's say, user B checks the message from the phone, so it will deliver the acknowledgement to chat server B, which sends the message to the phone,

1231
02:17:49,120 --> 02:18:02,884
之后，聊天服务器 B 会将此标记为已送达给聊天服务器 A，随后它就能发送到第一个用户的移动设备上，并将状态更新为已送达。
after which the chat server B will mark this as delivered for the chat server A, which then it will be able to send to the first user's mobile device and update the status to delivered.

1232
02:18:03,120 --> 02:18:07,120
接下来的动作是用户 B 阅读这条消息。
And next action that will happen is user B will read the message.

1233
02:18:07,214 --> 02:18:12,160
一旦他读了消息，我们就会把已读回执发送给聊天服务器 B。
So once it reads the message, we will send the read receipt to the chat server B.

1234
02:18:12,334 --> 02:18:19,780
然后这个聊天服务器 B 会再次将此信息转发给聊天服务器 A，并带上此时的已读状态。
And then this chat server B will again forward this to the chat server A with the message read status in this case.

1235
02:18:20,236 --> 02:18:25,316
接着聊天服务器 A 会更新状态，现在它会显示为红色。
And then the chat server A will update the status, and now it will display as red.

1236
02:18:25,772 --> 02:18:30,564
既然变红了，我们现在还需要在用户 B 的不同设备之间同步这个状态。
And since this is red, now we need to also sync that between the user B's devices.

1237
02:18:30,799 --> 02:18:37,252
所以聊天服务器 B 也会在用户 B 的这台笔记本电脑上将其标记为红色。
So the chat server B will mark it as red also on user B's laptop, which is here.

1238
02:18:37,646 --> 02:18:50,959
这样一来，用户 A 的平板、手机和桌面端，以及用户 B 的手机和笔记本，都能始终与最新数据保持同步，无论是消息是否已发送、是否已送达
So this way the user A's tablet, mobile phone and desktop, and also user B's phone and laptop always stay synced with the latest data, whether the message was sent, whether it was delivered

1239
02:18:51,120 --> 02:18:52,066
还是是否已被阅读。
or it was read.

1240
02:18:52,302 --> 02:19:01,412
如果多个设备之间出现冲突，我们将采用带版本号的「最后写入胜出」技术来防止冲突。
And in case there are conflicts between multiple devices, we will use the last right wins technique with version numbers to prevent the conflicts.

1241
02:19:01,902 --> 02:19:04,718
当然，这并不是最理想的解决方案。
And of course, this is not the ideal solution.

1242
02:19:04,910 --> 02:19:07,920
首先，我们需要在这里进行优化。
First of all, we need to apply optimization here.

1243
02:19:08,142 --> 02:19:15,588
例如，这里可以采用增量同步，因为向新设备发送完整的消息历史记录成本很高。
For example, this can be incremental sync because sending the entire message history to a new device is expensive.

1244
02:19:15,760 --> 02:19:23,280
假设我们正在与聊天服务器 B 同步用户手机，并与聊天服务器 E 同步用户的笔记本电脑。
Let's say we are syncing with this chat server B and user's phone and also user's laptop with chat server E.

1245
02:19:23,520 --> 02:19:26,948
我们不需要在设备上发送完整的历史记录。
We don't need to send the whole history in the device.

1246
02:19:27,374 --> 02:19:35,680
相反，设备可以请求最近 30 天的短信，因为大多数用户只需要近期的记录，而更旧的
So instead, the device can request messages for last 30 days, like most users only need the recent history, and older

1247
02:19:35,840 --> 02:19:44,196
消息会在需要时按需获取。当他们向上滚动时，用户向上滑动，旧消息就会开始加载。
messages are fetched on demand when needed. When they scroll up, the user scrolls up and then the old messages will start to load.

1248
02:19:44,638 --> 02:19:50,560
非常旧的消息将被存档在冷存储中，并采用懒加载。
And very old messages will be archived in cold storage and they will be loaded lazily.

1249
02:19:50,720 --> 02:19:59,428
增加这种多设备同步也伴随着权衡，因为我们需要承担大约两倍的送达工作量。
Adding this multi-device sync comes also with a trade-off because we need to support roughly double of the delivery workload.

1250
02:19:59,600 --> 02:20:02,900
每条消息都会发送到用户拥有的多个设备上。
Each message goes to multiple devices per users.

1251
02:20:03,566 --> 02:20:12,560
但这是像 WhatsApp 这样的聊天应用的一个重要功能，因为用户要求在他们的手机和
But that is an important feature of chat messaging app like WhatsApp because users demand the same messages, the same chats to be synced

1252
02:20:12,720 --> 02:20:16,004
桌面端应用之间同步相同的消息和对话。
between their mobile phones and between their desktop apps.

1253
02:20:16,526 --> 02:20:25,796
现在让我们看看核心流程：当两个用户都在线，或者其中一个用户可能离线时，消息实际上是如何流转的。
Now let's see the core flows on how messages actually move in case of users both being online and sometimes one of the users might be offline.

1254
02:20:26,382 --> 02:20:28,900
首先从双方都在线的版本开始。
So let's start with both online version.

1255
02:20:29,326 --> 02:20:36,228
在这种情况下，假设用户 A 向用户 B 发送消息，而用户 B 连接到聊天服务器 A。
In this case, user A let's say sends the message to user B and it's connected with the chat server A.

1256
02:20:36,846 --> 02:20:40,740
消息通过 WebSocket 并到达这个聊天服务器。
Message goes through WebSocket and reaches to this chat server.

1257
02:20:41,294 --> 02:20:49,508
现在这个聊天服务器会生成消息 ID，这是一个基于时间戳的、针对该消息的唯一 ID。
Now this chat server will generate the message ID, which is a unique ID timestamp based for this message,

1258
02:20:49,966 --> 02:20:54,820
然后它会发送一个确认信息，显示消息已发送的状态。
and then it will send the acknowledgement with status of the message being sent.

1259
02:20:55,470 --> 02:20:59,588
接着，这个服务器会将消息推送到消息队列中
Then this server will push the message to the message queue

1260
02:21:00,398 --> 02:21:01,380
以进行持久化。
for persistence.

1261
02:21:01,838 --> 02:21:10,496
之后，我们需要确认用户 B 在哪里以及连接到哪个服务器，以便我们将这条消息转发给用户 B。
After that, we need to check where user B is and which server it's connected to so that we can send forward this message to user B.

1262
02:21:10,798 --> 02:21:15,376
我们可以从 Redis 缓存中查到这些信息，那里存储了用户的连接缓存。
And we can check that from the Redis cache where we have the user connection cache.

1263
02:21:15,616 --> 02:21:19,044
我们将从这个缓存中读取用户 B 的位置。
We will read where the user B is from this cache.

1264
02:21:19,438 --> 02:21:23,296
假设系统返回结果显示用户 B 在服务器 B 上。
And then let's say it responds that user B is on server B.

1265
02:21:23,376 --> 02:21:30,884
一旦获取到这些信息，服务器 A 就可以通过 Redis PubSub 模型将消息路由到服务器 B。
And once we have that information, the server A can route message to server B via Redis PubSub model.

1266
02:21:31,534 --> 02:21:36,080
而在这一侧，我们有服务器 B，并且用户 B 正通过 WebSocket 与其连接。
And on this side we have the server B and user B connected with WebSocket.

1267
02:21:36,416 --> 02:21:43,684
于是服务器 B 现在会实时投递消息，而用户 B 的设备会确认已送达。
So server B will now deliver message in real time, and user B's device will acknowledge the delivery.

1268
02:21:44,078 --> 02:21:50,212
接下来，我们需要让第一个服务器知道消息已经转发并送达了。
Next we need to let the first server know that the message was forwarded and delivered.

1269
02:21:50,416 --> 02:21:59,616
因此，服务器 B 会向服务器 A 发送一个请求，确认转发送达，然后我们可以将状态更新为
So server B will make a request to the server A acknowledging the forward delivery, and then we can update the status with

1270
02:21:59,856 --> 02:22:01,216
「已送达」而不是「已发送」。
delivered instead of sent.

1271
02:22:01,536 --> 02:22:09,636
然后每当用户 B 打开这条消息时，同样的过程会重复一遍，而我们现在会将消息标记为「已读」。
And then whenever user B opens the message, this same process will repeat and we will now mark the message as read instead.

1272
02:22:09,936 --> 02:22:20,068
此外，我们还可以通过在服务器 A 与消息队列之间进行异步处理，将消息放入队列用于分析或归档。
And optionally we can also enqueue the message for analytics or archival by using async processing between server A and between the message queue.

1273
02:22:20,336 --> 02:22:29,060
与此同时，消息队列会将消息写入像 Cassandra 这样的消息数据库中以存储历史记录。
And meanwhile, the message queue will be writing the message to the message database like Cassandra for storing the history.

1274
02:22:29,614 --> 02:22:37,668
现在让我们看看同样的流程，但在用户 B 处于离线状态的情况下，这会让管理变得稍微复杂一些，
Now let's see this same flow, but in case when the user B is offline, which makes it a bit harder to manage,

1275
02:22:38,318 --> 02:22:46,276
但我们仍需确保消息被接收到，并且在用户收到消息时通知他们，即使他们当时是离线的。
but still we need to make sure that the message is received and we also notify the user B when they received, even when they were offline.

1276
02:22:46,798 --> 02:22:50,416
在这种情况下，初始步骤是一样的。
So the initial steps are the same for this situation.

1277
02:22:50,736 --> 02:22:58,816
用户 A 通过聊天服务器 A 向用户 B 发送消息，然后我们从 Redis 缓存中检查用户 B 是否在线
User A sends the message to user B through chat server A, and then we check whether the user B is online

1278
02:22:59,056 --> 02:23:00,644
从 Redis 缓存中。
from the Redis cache.

1279
02:23:00,976 --> 02:23:10,404
如果用户 B 处于离线状态（也就是我们现在的情况），我们将把消息添加到用户 B 的 Redis 收件箱中，
And in case the user B is offline, which is our situation here, we will add the message to user B's inbox with Redis,

1280
02:23:10,926 --> 02:23:15,236
然后将其存储在数据库的收件箱表中。
and then we will store this in inbox table in the database inbox.

1281
02:23:15,936 --> 02:23:24,816
之后，这个聊天服务器将连接到我们这里的通知服务，并为用户 B 发送推送通知。
And after that, this chat server will connect with the notification service that we have here and send push notifications for user B.

1282
02:23:24,976 --> 02:23:33,796
一旦通知服务收到消息，它还会通过 Apple 或 Google 的通知系统触发推送通知。
Once the notification service receives the message, it also triggers push notification through Apple's or Google's notification system.

1283
02:23:34,382 --> 02:23:39,460
然后我们将消息放入队列进行进一步处理到消息队列中。
And then we enqueue the message for further processing to the message queue.

1284
02:23:39,936 --> 02:23:43,780
之后，消息队列会将此内容持久化到数据库中。
And after that, message queue will persist this into the database.

1285
02:23:44,496 --> 02:23:52,896
一旦用户 B 重新上线，假设他们打开了应用并与聊天服务器建立 WebSocket 连接，
And once the user B comes back online, let's say they open the app and establish the WebSocket connection with chat server

1286
02:23:53,998 --> 02:24:01,316
我们将把消息转发给具有与用户 B WebSocket 连接的聊天服务器 C。
we will forward the message for delivery to the chat server C, which has the WebSocket connection with user B.

1287
02:24:01,696 --> 02:24:06,212
之后，我们将实时将消息投递到用户 B 的设备上。
And after that, we will deliver the message in real time to the user B's device.

1288
02:24:07,630 --> 02:24:18,052
如果用户 B 在此期间在线，我们只需将消息转发到用户 B 连接的那个聊天服务器，假设是聊天服务器 C。
In case user B was online during this time, we would just forward the message for delivery to the chat server where the user B is connected. Let's say it's the chat server C.

1289
02:24:18,446 --> 02:24:25,540
但如果用户 B 最初处于离线状态现在变为可用，那么流程就是这样的。
But if user B was offline first and now they become available, this is the flow that we will have.

1290
02:24:25,902 --> 02:24:29,616
所以，假设用户 B 在离线一段时间后重新上线。
So let's say user B comes online after being offline for a while.

1291
02:24:29,776 --> 02:24:36,576
我们已经发送了推送通知，他们连接到其中一个聊天服务器，比如聊天服务器 C。
We already sent the push notification and they connect to one of the chat servers, like chat server C.

1292
02:24:36,750 --> 02:24:43,332
该服务器首先要做的是从 Redis 中获取收件箱里的待处理消息。
First thing we will do from this server is we will retrieve the pending messages from the inbox from Redis.

1293
02:24:43,936 --> 02:24:55,300
如果有任何待处理消息，我们将从数据库收件箱中获取这些遗漏的消息，并将这些待处理消息送达给用户 B。
And if there are any messages that are pending, we will retrieve them, any missed messages from the database inbox, and we will deliver the pending messages to user B.

1294
02:24:55,726 --> 02:25:01,668
与之前的流程类似，我们还会通知用户 A 该消息已被阅读。
And similar to the previous flow, we will also notify the user A that the message was read.

1295
02:25:02,158 --> 02:25:11,332
接下来，我们需要为群聊设计类似的逻辑，看看如何在 WhatsApp 中处理 50 到 100 人的群组。
Next, we need to design this for group messages as well and see how we can handle 50 to 100 person groups in WhatsApp.

1296
02:25:11,696 --> 02:25:14,096
从高层级来看，情况是这样的。
This is how it will look like at a high level.

1297
02:25:14,190 --> 02:25:17,412
假设我们在同一个群聊中有多个用户。
Let's say we have multiple users in the same group chat.

1298
02:25:17,966 --> 02:25:22,576
我们首先需要一个群组服务来管理这些群组。
We will first of all need a group service which will be managing these groups.

1299
02:25:22,766 --> 02:25:31,492
举个例子，假设用户 A 是这个群的一员，而且这个群里还有另外 50 到 100 人。
And as an example, let's say user A is part of this group, and we have another 50 to 100 persons in this group.

1300
02:25:32,110 --> 02:25:36,656
第一个流程是当用户 A 向群里发送消息时。
First flow is when user A sends a message to the group.

1301
02:25:36,910 --> 02:25:41,252
假设正如我们在数据模型中描述的那样，每个群组都有一个 ID。
Let's say for each group we have ID as we described in the data model.

1302
02:25:41,696 --> 02:25:45,444
这条信息会被发送到他们连接的聊天服务器。
This gets sent to the chat server where they are connected.

1303
02:25:46,030 --> 02:25:55,844
然后，聊天服务器发出的第一个请求将是去群组服务查询谁在这个群里，比如 ID 为 789 的这个群。
And then the chat server, first request it will make to the group service, is to check who's in this group, which is ID of 789 as an example.

1304
02:25:56,096 --> 02:26:02,976
它会获取该群中所有用户的列表，也就是属于这个群的用户 ID。
And it will retrieve the list of users, like user IDs who are in this group, part of this group.

1305
02:26:03,216 --> 02:26:14,532
之后，我们可以检查这 50 个用户的状态。我们可以使用 Redis 来缓存用户状态，以免浪费数据库查询来读取这些信息。
And after that, we can check the status of these 50 users. We can use Redis to cache the status of users to not waste the database queries for reading this.

1306
02:26:14,990 --> 02:26:23,616
假设我们检查了这 50 个用户的状态，发现其中 30 人在线，剩下的 20 人……
And let's say we check the status of the 50 users and find out that 30 of them are online and the rest, the 20 other users,

1307
02:26:23,776 --> 02:26:24,420
……处于离线状态。
are offline.

1308
02:26:25,006 --> 02:26:29,764
对于每一个在线用户，我们需要查到他们连接在哪个聊天服务器上。
For each online user, we need to look up which chat server they are on.

1309
02:26:30,126 --> 02:26:38,176
因此，我们将发布给用户 1 到用户 30 的消息到 Redis 的 pub/sub 模型中。
So we will publish to channel user 1, user 2 to user 30 to the Redis pop sub model.

1310
02:26:38,670 --> 02:26:42,496
然后，这会并行地送达给在线用户。
And then this will parallelly deliver to online users.

1311
02:26:42,656 --> 02:26:48,496
任何在线的用户，都会在他们连接的自己的聊天服务器上收到消息。
Whoever is online, they will receive their messages in their own chat server where they are connected.

1312
02:26:48,686 --> 02:26:55,536
假设有 15 个用户连接到服务器 B，另外 15 个用户连接到服务器 C。
Let's say 15 of the users are connected to server B and the other 15 are connected to server C.

1313
02:26:55,696 --> 02:27:02,916
我们将并行地把消息分发到这两个服务器，然后这些服务器将通过 WebSockets 分发它们。
We will in parallel distribute the message to both servers, and then these servers will distribute them via WebSockets.

1314
02:27:03,296 --> 02:27:12,164
所以它会通过 WebSocket 送达给来自服务器 B 的 15 个用户，以及来自服务器 C 的另外 15 个用户。
So it will deliver via WebSocket to the 15 users from server B and to the other 15 users from server C.

1315
02:27:12,686 --> 02:27:23,396
对于每一次送达，用户的设备都会确认消息已送达，连接到另一个服务器的另外 15 人也是一样的情况。
For each of these deliveries, they will acknowledge from user's device that the message was delivered, and same for the other 15 who are connected to the other server,

1316
02:27:23,822 --> 02:27:31,044
然后我们将这些确认信息转发给最初发送消息的服务器 A。
and then we will forward these acknowledgements to the server A, which originally sent the message.

1317
02:27:31,534 --> 02:27:38,820
这样它就能在用户 A 的设备上将消息状态更新为“已送达”。
So that it can update the status of the message to send or delivered in the user A's device.

1318
02:27:39,216 --> 02:27:48,120
对于另外 20 个离线的用户，我们需要使用与一对一连接中处理离线用户时相同的方法。
For the other 20 users who are offline, we need to use the same thing generally that we did for the offline users in one-on-one

1319
02:27:48,256 --> 02:27:48,804
……
connection.

1320
02:27:49,390 --> 02:28:00,388
我们需要一个 Redis 收件箱，将他们需要接收的消息写入其中，也就是这另外 20 个离线的用户，我们将把信息写入他们的收件箱。
We'll need a Redis inbox where we will write the messages that they need to receive, which is let's say these other 20 users who were offline, we will write it to user inboxes.

1321
02:28:00,750 --> 02:28:05,636
我们将向数据库中的 20 个收件箱记录写入数据。
And we will write to 20 inbox records in the database inbox.

1322
02:28:06,606 --> 02:28:15,456
对于这些人，我们需要通过 Apple 或 Google 的推送通知系统发送推送通知，来告知他们
And for all of them, we need to send the push notification either through Apple's or Google's push notification system to notify them through

1323
02:28:15,662 --> 02:28:19,696
消息已在群组中发出。
notification service that the message was sent in the group.

1324
02:28:20,014 --> 02:28:26,212
然后通知服务会通过 Apple 或 Google 的通知系统推送出去。
And then the notification service will push this through either Apple's or Google's notification system.

1325
02:28:27,150 --> 02:28:29,572
这样一来，我们只需要存储一次消息。
So this way we are just storing message once.

1326
02:28:29,696 --> 02:28:38,016
因此，从接收到用户消息的聊天服务器 A 到消息队列，只执行了一次写入操作。
So we are doing one write operation from chat server A, which received the message from the user to the message queue.

1327
02:28:38,096 --> 02:28:40,256
然后消息队列将此内容写入数据库。
And then message queue writes this to the database.

1328
02:28:40,398 --> 02:28:43,652
所以最终每条消息只需一次写入操作。
So eventually it is just one write operation per message.

1329
02:28:43,936 --> 02:28:53,376
最后，我们将更新状态：对于用户 A 的设备，显示已送达 30 人，还有 20 人处于待处理状态。
And lastly, we will also update the status that it was delivered to 30 and it is pending to 20 users for the user A's device.

1330
02:28:53,806 --> 02:29:00,292
到目前为止，我们还没有讨论如何管理媒体文件、图像资源和视频。
Now, so far we haven't covered how we are going to manage the media files, the image assets, the videos.

1331
02:29:00,416 --> 02:29:02,148
接下来我们来讲讲这个。
So let's cover that next.

1332
02:29:02,606 --> 02:29:12,816
当然，错误的做法是让客户端将图片上传到聊天服务器，然后由聊天服务器存入数据库，再由接收者从
Of course, the wrong way here will be to clients upload the image to the chat server and then chat server store it in database and then recipient downloads from

1333
02:29:12,976 --> 02:29:13,668
聊天服务器下载。
chat server.

1334
02:29:13,998 --> 02:29:15,616
这种做法显然不可扩展。
This is of course not scalable.

1335
02:29:15,776 --> 02:29:24,164
你的聊天服务器会因为文件传输而受到带宽限制，而且它们没在做擅长的事情，即快速路由消息，
Your chat servers are now bandwidth limited by file transfers, and they are not doing what they are good at, which is routing messages quickly,

1336
02:29:24,398 --> 02:29:28,996
反而去做了一些它们很不擅长的事情，也就是搬运大块数据。
and instead they are doing what they are terrible at, which is moving large blobs around.

1337
02:29:29,550 --> 02:29:32,964
所以正确的做法是使用预签名 URL。
So the right approach is using pre-signed URLs.

1338
02:29:33,056 --> 02:29:41,856
对于这些技术术语，比如预签名 URL、通知服务、Apple 通知服务等，都会包含在脚注中。
And for all these technical terms like pre-signed URLs, notification services, Apple's notification service, these kind of things will be included in the footnotes.

1339
02:29:41,998 --> 02:29:45,284
如果你不确定它们是什么，可以去那里查看。
If you're not sure what they are, feel free to check it there.

1340
02:29:45,870 --> 02:29:49,284
现在让我们来看看上传媒体文件的正确方法。
So let's look at the correct approach for uploading the media files.

1341
02:29:49,456 --> 02:29:51,332
从上传流程开始。
Let's start with the upload flow.

1342
02:29:51,470 --> 02:30:01,444
假设我们有用户 A，他是该网站上的文件发送者；我们有用户 A 的设备（即应用）；还有接收文件的用户 B。
Let's say we have user A, who's the sender of the file on this site, and we have user A's device, which is the app, and we have user B who will be receiving the file.

1343
02:30:02,158 --> 02:30:10,976
当用户 A 点击发送消息时，应用程序会向其连接的聊天服务器请求预签名上传 URL。
So, user A taps to send a message, and this is where the application will request pre-signed upload URL from the chat server

1344
02:30:11,136 --> 02:30:14,276
假设这就是服务器 A。
which they are connected to. Let's say this is the server A.

1345
02:30:14,734 --> 02:30:23,136
在这一步，聊天服务器将生成一个预签名上传 URL，用于将文件上传到某些块对象存储中，比如 AWS S3。
At this step, the chat server will generate pre-signed upload URL to upload this into some blob storage like AWSS3.

1346
02:30:23,630 --> 02:30:31,616
块对象存储会将上传 URL 返回给聊天服务器，然后我们将这个 URL 转交给用户 A 的应用。
The blob storage will return the upload URL to the chat server, and then we will forward this URL to user A's application.

1347
02:30:31,822 --> 02:30:37,296
一旦获取到这个上传 URL，用户 A 的应用就可以进行直接上传。
Once they have this upload URL, the user A's application can do a direct upload.

1348
02:30:37,456 --> 02:30:45,696
它可以利用我们刚从服务器获得的预签名 URL 来上传媒体内容，这将直接上传到 S3 桶中。
It can upload the media using the pre-signed URL we just got from the server, and this will upload it directly to the S3 bucket.

1349
02:30:45,902 --> 02:30:51,908
然后 S3 将确认该上传，并返回一个用于后续访问的媒体 URL。
And then S3 will confirm that upload and return the media URL for accessing it later.

1350
02:30:52,270 --> 02:31:01,296
在下一步中，我们就可以将包含媒体文件 URL 的聊天消息发送到我们连接的聊天服务器 A 了。
And in the next step, we can already send that chat message, including the media file URL, to the chat server A, which we are connected to.

1351
02:31:01,518 --> 02:31:08,548
这时我们需要通知用户 B 已收到消息，并包含这个媒体文件 URL。
And this is where we need to notify the user B that they received the message and also include this media file URL.

1352
02:31:09,038 --> 02:31:14,736
这样就会把带有媒体 URL 的消息发送到用户 B 的应用中。
So it will deliver the message with media URL to user B's application.

1353
02:31:15,022 --> 02:31:17,796
首先，用户 B 会收到通知。
So first user B will receive the notification.

1354
02:31:18,542 --> 02:31:26,276
接着，他们会连接到聊天服务器。假设这是他们通过 WebSockets 连接的聊天服务器 B。
Next, they will connect to the chat server. Let's say this is the chat server B that they are connected to with via web sockets.

1355
02:31:26,576 --> 02:31:30,500
这样他们就能收到包含媒体文件 URL 的消息了。
So they will receive the messages along with the media file URL.

1356
02:31:31,056 --> 02:31:33,776
然后，他们点击查看媒体。
And now then they tap to view the media.

1357
02:31:33,936 --> 02:31:37,156
这时我们将请求预签名下载 URL。
This is where we will request the pre-signed download URL.

1358
02:31:37,616 --> 02:31:45,988
在这种情况下，我们将从聊天服务器 B 获取来自 S3 上我们拥有的块对象存储的预签名下载 URL。
And in this case, we will generate the pre-signed download URL from the chat server B with the blob storage that we have on S3.

1359
02:31:46,446 --> 02:31:54,948
然后 S3 会将下载 URL 返回给这个聊天服务器 B，我们可以将其转发给用户 B 的应用
And then S3 will return the download URL to this chat server B, which we can now forward to the user B's application

1360
02:31:55,296 --> 02:31:57,988
以便它打开并查看媒体文件。
for it to open and review the media file.

1361
02:31:58,336 --> 02:32:02,692
这里有两种下载和读取媒体文件的方法。
And then here we have two approaches for downloading and reading the media file.

1362
02:32:03,056 --> 02:32:10,916
更具扩展性的方法是通过 CDN，我们可以将媒体文件复制到各个 CDN，从而更靠近每个用户。
The more scalable approach is via CDNs, so we can replicate the media files across CDNs to be closer to each user.

1363
02:32:11,406 --> 02:32:15,076
在这种情况下，我们将通过 CDN 下载媒体文件。
And in this case, we will download the media file through CDN.

1364
02:32:15,216 --> 02:32:23,524
这是用户应用，这是 CDN，他们将从那里读取并流式传输媒体到用户应用中。
So this is the user application and this is the CDN, and they will read it from there and stream the media back to the user application.

1365
02:32:24,110 --> 02:32:28,016
最简单的方法是直接从存储中读取。
And the simplest approach is to just read it directly from the storage.

1366
02:32:28,174 --> 02:32:33,124
也就是说，用户会请求直接从 S3 桶下载媒体文件。
So the user will request to download the media file directly from the S3 bucket.

1367
02:32:33,376 --> 02:32:35,056
它将流式传输回媒体。
It will stream back the media.

1368
02:32:35,182 --> 02:32:40,484
当然，这里在直接从存储读取和从 CDN 读取之间存在权衡。
And of course, here we have a trade-off between directly reading from the storage or from CDN.

1369
02:32:40,718 --> 02:32:47,620
使用 CDN 的流程稍微复杂一点，因为我们需要进行额外的请求来获取预签名 URL。
We have slightly more complex flow with CDNs because we need to do extra requests to get the pre-signed URL.

1370
02:32:48,016 --> 02:32:52,336
但在这种规模下，性能和成本方面的优势是巨大的。
But the performance and cost benefits here are massive for this scale.

1371
02:32:52,416 --> 02:33:02,336
因此，CDN 很可能是最佳的解决方案和选择，因为如果没有它，单个处理 10 万个连接的聊天服务器
So CDN is most likely the best solution and option to go with because without this, a single chat server handling 100,000 let's say connections

1372
02:33:02,496 --> 02:33:10,496
可能会被仅仅 100 个用户同时将一些几兆的小文件上传到块
can get crushed by just 100 users simultaneously uploading some small megabyte files into the blob

1373
02:33:10,656 --> 02:33:11,012
对象存储中而崩溃。
storage.

1374
02:33:11,566 --> 02:33:18,116
有了这个架构，像服务器 A 这样的聊天服务器只处理简短的文本和消息。
So with this setup, the chat servers like the server A only handles the small text and messages.

1375
02:33:18,542 --> 02:33:27,296
每当我们需要上传一些大型文件，比如视频、图像或语音备忘录时，我们会将这些高带宽需求卸载到某些块
And whenever we need to upload some heavy files like videos, images, or voice notes, we will offload that heavy bandwidth to some blob

1376
02:33:27,456 --> 02:33:29,188
对象存储或到某些 CDN。
storage or to some CDN.

1377
02:33:29,614 --> 02:33:34,596
我们将使用预签名 URL，它们将在我们设置的 生存时间 后过期。
And we will use presigned URLs which will expire after the TTL that we will set.

1378
02:33:35,182 --> 02:33:41,220
然后媒体的 生存时间 将与我们在聊天服务器中设置的保留策略保持一致。
And then the media TTL will align also with the retention policy that we have in the chat servers.

1379
02:33:41,616 --> 02:33:49,572
有了这个架构，聊天服务器仅负责路由带有 URL 的简短消息，而块对象存储和 CDN 将处理高带宽需求。
So with this setup, chat servers only route small messages with URLs, and blob storage and CDS will handle the heavy bandwidth.

1380
02:33:50,016 --> 02:33:57,456
我们的聊天服务器将保持高效并专注于它们的工作，即传递消息和媒体文件。
and our chat servers stay fast and focused on their job, which is delivering the messages, and media files.

1381
02:33:57,456 --> 02:34:08,900
获取 生存时间，即生存时间，设置自动过期时间为，比如 30 天，这与消息保留期一致，之后它们就会被自动删除。
get the TTL, which stands for time to live, with automatic expiration of, let's say 30 days, which will match the message retention, and then they will get automatically deleted.

1382
02:34:09,614 --> 02:34:17,700
现在我们来看看如何扩展这个系统，因为我们的聊天服务现在可以同时处理数千个用户，
Now let's get into how we would scale this because our chat services now can handle thousands of users concurrently,

1383
02:34:18,192 --> 02:34:24,324
但如果我们想进一步扩展，就需要考虑一种解耦服务器的方法。
but if we want to scale it even further, we need to think of a way to decouple our servers.

1384
02:34:24,912 --> 02:34:30,372
最常用的方法是使用某种消息队列，比如 Kafka。
And the most common approach here is using some sort of message queue like a Kafka.

1385
02:34:30,672 --> 02:34:37,712
在我们的架构中，可以在这一侧设置消息队列，然后给这里的每个实例分配分区。
For our setup, we can have message queue on this side, and then we can assign partitions to each instance over here.

1386
02:34:37,872 --> 02:34:40,644
我们有这些消息存储服务实例。
We have the message storage service instances.

1387
02:34:40,832 --> 02:34:45,392
假设我们将规模扩大到 2、3 个甚至更多的实例。
Let's say we scale it up to 2, 3, or even more instances.

1388
02:34:45,552 --> 02:34:51,300
由于这是一个无状态实例，我们可以根据需要扩展到任意数量。
Since this is like a stateless instance, we can scale it to as much, as many as needed.

1389
02:34:51,854 --> 02:34:55,232
所以我们可以给这些实例中的每一个都分配分区。
So we can assign partitions to each of these instances.

1390
02:34:55,312 --> 02:35:05,956
举个例子，比如这部分可以是 0 到 9，那部分是 10 到 19，再来一部分是 20 到 29，我们将这些分区分别分配给这里的各个实例。
And as an example, like this can be from 0 to 9, this can be 10 to 19, this can be 20 to 29 partitions that we will assign to each of these instances here.

1391
02:35:06,414 --> 02:35:15,872
它的工作原理是：消息到达这个消息队列后，每个实例都会从 Kafka 中消费这些消息。
And the way it will work is we will have messages that arrive to this message queue, and then each instance will consume these messages from Kafka.

1392
02:35:16,032 --> 02:35:23,556
为了提高效率，我们甚至可以进行批量写入，然后在实例内部处理重试和失败情况。
We can even do batch writes for efficiency, and then we will handle retries and failures inside of an instance.

1393
02:35:23,792 --> 02:35:27,588
所以首先，在每个实例中都有一个 Kafka 消费者。
So first we have the Kafka consumer in each of these instances.

1394
02:35:28,142 --> 02:35:32,932
我们将尝试使用批量写入将这些内容写入数据库集群。
We will try to use batch writing to write this to the database cluster.

1395
02:35:33,392 --> 02:35:43,392
如果由于任何原因失败了，我们会在每个集群内部设置重试逻辑，在经过一段时间的超时后再次尝试批量写入
If for any reason this fails, we will have a retry logic inside of each of these clusters, and then we will retry to batch write after some timeout

1396
02:35:43,712 --> 02:35:45,956
并将这些内容写入数据库集群。
and write this to the database cluster.

1397
02:35:46,432 --> 02:35:58,116
如果仍然失败，我们要确保不从消息队列中删除该消息，以免丢失信息，或者我们可以使用一种叫做
And if for any reason this still fails, we make sure that we don't delete the message from the message queue so that we don't end up losing the messages, or we can use something which is called

1398
02:35:58,510 --> 02:35:59,552
死信队列。
dead letter queue.

1399
02:35:59,872 --> 02:36:03,076
这些是你可以与主队列分开使用的队列。
These are queues that you can use separate from the main queue.

1400
02:36:03,438 --> 02:36:11,652
因此，每当这里的某些消息在实例中处理失败时，它们会被存入这个死信队列中，
So whenever some of the messages here fails to be processed from the instance, it will instead be stored in this dead letter queue,

1401
02:36:11,792 --> 02:36:19,524
然后我们可以通过其他机制在同一个实例中稍后处理这些信息，并将其写入数据库。
and then we can have some other mechanisms here for processing it later inside of the same instance and writing it to the database.

1402
02:36:20,302 --> 02:36:25,444
一旦数据库写入成功，我们还需要更新索引。
And then once a database write is successful, we need to also update the indexes.

1403
02:36:25,552 --> 02:36:33,552
因此，每个实例内部都会有一个索引更新器，用于更新数据库中的索引以便搜索
So inside of each instance we will have the index updater, which will update the indexing in the database for searching

1404
