1646
03:02:22,160 --> 03:02:30,020
然后我们会执行类似查询所有来自 messages.inbox 且 delivered 为空（即尚未设置）的记录
and then we will query something like select all from messages. inbox, where the delivered is null, which is not set in inbox.

1647
03:02:30,480 --> 03:02:37,316
接着，对于每条未送达的消息，我们都会写入 Redis 收件箱，同时保留数据库记录
and then for each undelivered message, we will write to Redis inbox, and then we will keep the database record as well.

1648
03:02:37,774 --> 03:02:45,188
之后，我们将恢复到正常的交付流程，即写入 Redis 然后再次从 Redis 读取
So after that, we will resume to the normal delivery, which is writing to Redis and then reading from Redis again.

1649
03:02:46,382 --> 03:02:52,640
为了在代码层面可视化这一点，这就是带回退机制的写入逻辑示例
So to visualize this at the code level, this is for example what the write with fallback will look like.

1650
03:02:52,814 --> 03:03:00,548
我们将拥有一个类似 store_undelivered_message 的函数，它包含消息的用户 ID 以及消息本身
So we will have some function like store undelivered message, which will be the user ID of the message and then the message itself.

1651
03:03:01,102 --> 03:03:04,800
所以我们首先尝试从缓存中读取 Redis。
So we will first try reading Redis from the cache.

1652
03:03:04,880 --> 03:03:10,948
我们将尝试通过这个用户 ID 和消息的时间戳，从 Redis 缓存中获取这条消息。
So we will try to get the message with this user ID with the message timestamp from Redis cache.

1653
03:03:11,374 --> 03:03:18,880
但如果这步出错了，我们需要记录 Redis 不可用，并重新开始使用数据库。
But in case this goes wrong, we need to log that Redis is unavailable and we will need to start using database again.

1654
03:03:18,990 --> 03:03:21,508
所以我们需要从数据库中查询这条信息。
