1655
03:03:21,774 --> 03:03:30,400
如果消息是写入给另一个用户的，这可以是一个插入操作；或者如果用户正在尝试获取消息而 Redis 不可用，这就是一个像 select 这样的读取操作。
This can be either insert operation if the message was written to the other user, or this can be a read operation like select operation

1656
03:03:30,560 --> 03:03:34,724
如果用户正试图获取消息且 Redis 不可用。
if the user is trying to fetch the messages and Redis is unavailable.

1657
03:03:35,630 --> 03:03:41,920
这就是第二个场景。例如，我们正在尝试获取未送达的消息，所以我们尝试从 Redis 中读取它。
So that is the second scenario. For example, we are trying to get undelivered messages, so we are trying to read it from Redis.

1658
03:03:42,000 --> 03:03:46,948
这再次是尝试从 Redis 读取，因为如果它可用，这是最快的方式。
This is again trying to read from Redis because that is the fastest if it's available first.

1659
03:03:47,470 --> 03:03:54,020
如果我们看到消息长度大于零，我们就会进行解析映射，然后发送给用户。
If we see that messages length is greater than zero, then we will map parse and then send it to the user.

1660
03:03:54,400 --> 03:03:59,360
但如果这个 try 代码块中出了问题，那就意味着 Redis 不可用。
But in case something goes wrong in this try block, that means that the Redis is unavailable.

1661
03:03:59,470 --> 03:04:05,200
所以我们还是会记录日志，以便后续在 CloudWatch 或其他地方进行追踪。
So again, we will log for us for tracing it later in CloudWatch or somewhere else.

1662
03:04:05,440 --> 03:04:17,120
之后，我们需要再次从数据库中读取。我们会执行到数据库的 select 查询，这虽然变慢了，但比整个操作失败要好。
And after that, we'll need to again read this from the database. So we'll do the select query instead to the database, which is again slower, but it's better than just failing the whole operation.

1663
03:04:17,262 --> 03:04:23,680
然后一旦 Redis 重新上线，它就会与数据库同步，获取所有的消息。
And then once the Redis is back online, it will sync with the database, have all the messages here.

1664
03:04:23,840 --> 03:04:26,692
所以下次我们将从这个 try 块中读取。
So next time we will be reading from this tri block.

