03:05:28,942 --> 03:05:35,024
在这个区域中，我们将拥有完整的技术栈，首先是他们连接到的负载均衡器。
And in this region, we will have the full stack, which will be the load balancer that they will first connect to.

1675
03:05:35,104 --> 03:05:44,144
他们在这里发起请求，由系统将他们路由到聊天服务器。这里我们会部署更多副本的聊天服务器，且每个区域的情况可能不同。
They will make a request here to route them to the chat server. Here we will have more chat servers replicated, and for each region, this can be different.

